//==============================================================================
//  td_font5x7.v  --  5x7 uppercase font for the detection OSD
//  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  Generated by gen_font5x7.py, do not edit by hand.
//  One combinational ROM.  The OSD scales each glyph x2 in both directions, so
//  a character cell is 16x16 px.  Only the glyphs the OSD prints are included,
//  which makes this far smaller than the 16x16 vendor font it replaces.
//==============================================================================

